<title>UK: FHLB sets $200 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>FHLB sets $200 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER **THE FEDERAL HOUSING FINANCE BOARD</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.711     MATURITY    20.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  16.5 BP   REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES    **ON BEHALF OF THE TWELVE FEDERAL HOME LOAN BANKS</p>
<p>(FHLB)</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE AT PAR ON ANY COUPON DATE FROM SECOND</p>
<p>		YEAR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
